Coverage: complete. Product tests were not run.

Source context: {"language":"JavaScript","runtime":"unresolved","role":"imported","component":"js"}

## Whole-file declarations, data, registration and contextual obligations (unit-1)

Creates a DateTimeFormat with hour, minute and second fields and derives expected from format(0), preserving the chosen locale and time zone. It compares formatting ten inputs spanning negative and positive fractions smaller than1, signed zero and the smallest positive/negative Number value to the zero result. It checks truncation near zero without hard-coding locale text, then reports normal completion.


